source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A color macro reads its value with the macro parameter rule, so the escaped `#` is part of the color.
-- input.jira --
{color:\#ff0000}x{color}
-- rendered.html --
<p><font color="#ff0000">x</font></p>
-- want.md --
<font color="#ff0000">x</font>
-- warnings.json --
[]
